"""The tenant reports every product ships: what this organization is doing
in this product, over the tables the starter itself creates.

Six reports, each a resolver over the tenant session with the tenant id
bound as a parameter -- belt as well as braces, because row-level security
is forced on every table read here and a reader of a resolver should still
see what it selects. Nothing here names a product's domain; that is
`reports.py`, the extension point beside this file.

Every series is drawn in the bucket the range decided -- `day`, `week` or
`month`, one of three fixed words chosen in `koras_reporting.filters` and
never by a caller -- which is the one value interpolated into a statement
rather than bound.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

from collections.abc import Sequence
from datetime import date
from typing import Any

